  "problems": "TOTEME has no general size-guide page (toteme.com/pages/size-guide returns 404); every chart is a per-product GARMENT chart, so the numbers are the item's measurements, not body sizes, and they differ by style (a body-to-size mapping needs ease assumptions the brand does not publish). Three current denim styles and one trouser recorded; other styles will differ. Hip is the row labelled \"SEAT\". Denim inseam depends on the length bought (23/28 ... 32/34), so inseam is null and the per-length values are in inseam_by_length; rows also carry thigh and rise (front_rise for Classic slim). Inches tables also published. Trouser sizes 30 and 44 have garment measurements but no row in the size-conversion table (which covers EU 32-42 with UK, US, IT, AU, RU, JP)."
